  clock: 4  # ad79
  nonce: ad79  # ad79
  message: "DECISIVE MEASUREMENT (owner-fired manual cron on dev 5aed26a8d1, the\npost-climb post-everything tree): 1 failed, 23,003 passed — the same test,\nthe same `assert []`. This KILLS the previous entry's leading hypothesis\n(latent ordering-shift \"fixed\" by the climb PRs): the current tree still\nfails. The failure is PIPELINE-conditional, not tree-conditional.\n\nTHE AXIS TABLE, everything measured to date:\n\n  nightly test-matrix   3.10/3.11/3.12/3.13  WITH meta-pkg   GREEN x4\n  full-suite cron       3.11                 NO meta-pkg     RED (this test only)\n  local (this box)      3.12                 NO meta-pkg     GREEN:\n      - single test                                  pass (1.18s)\n      - whole core suite, xdist -n 4                 pass (11,757 others)\n      - cross-package interleaved suite, xdist       pass (20,026 others)\n\nEvery locally reachable configuration passes. The failure has only ever\nbeen observed in the full-suite container, and the last observable delta\nbetween the green and red pipelines is ONE install token: nightly's test\nstep installs `-e packages/hypergumbo` (the meta-package — light; torch is\nbehind [embeddings]) and full-suite's did not.\n\nEXPERIMENT SHIPPED: full-suite's test step now installs the meta-package\n(install-set parity with nightly — a silent two-pipeline drift worth\nremoving regardless). Next cron (scheduled 13:00 UTC, or another manual\nfire) is the readout:\n  - GREEN  -> the axis is the install set; mechanism hunt narrows to what\n    a meta DISTRIBUTION's presence changes (candidate: analyzer_identity\n    walks importlib.metadata.distributions(); the meta adds a distribution\n    record and the `hypergumbo` console script).\n  - STILL RED -> container/interpreter interaction (no-meta x 3.11 x\n    container); INV-libib (four nightly leg logs collapse to one) becomes\n    the prerequisite, since per-leg attribution is the remaining\n    instrument gap, plus docker-group access for a faithful local\n    container repro.\n\nAlso from this run: the cron-arm self-claims-gate executed and PASSED in\nthe failing pipeline (\"18 claims unchanged\") — the gate and this failure\nare independent."  # ad79
